    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ExtensionAwareEvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>ExtensionAwareEvaluationContextProvider</code></a> for the given <a href=\"spi/EvaluationContextExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel.spi\"><code>EvaluationContextExtension</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a href=\"spi/EvaluationContextExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel.spi\"><code>EvaluationContextExtension</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"ExtensionAwareEvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>ExtensionAwareEvaluationContextProvider</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ExtensionAwareEvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>ExtensionAwareEvaluationContextProvider</code></a> with extensions looked up lazily from the given\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 <a href=\"ExtensionAwareEvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>ExtensionAwareEvaluationContextProvider</code></a>，其扩展项将从给定的\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 中懒加载。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> built using the given parameter values.",
      "translation": "返回一个使用给定参数值构建的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>rootObject</code> - the root object to set in the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>rootObject</code> - 要在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> 中设置的根对象。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
